 Quassel, Kopete, Irssi, BitchX, XChat, Konversation, KVIrc, Pidgin, ircII, WeeChat, Polari

macOS:
 Textual, Snak, Ircle, Adium, Colloquy, KVIrc, LimeChat, IRCCloud

